    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57916" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῑμᾰκ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>use the wrestler's trick called</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῖμαξ</span> (signf. <i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
